<title>GERMANY: Allianz plans no capital rise in 1997.</title>
<headline>Allianz plans no capital rise in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Allianz AG does not plan to raise capital this year, the group's chief financial officer said.</p>
<p>Diethart Breipohl told a news conference: &quot;A capital increase is not planned for this year.&quot;</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
